    {
      "id": "RH01",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: selected rename history and name-path resolution",
      "from": "VmModuleBaseDecorator.IsReName / Name",
      "to": "空root标记与改名part的注册时机",
      "behavior": "IsReName从不同值改true先写字段，再Ioc.Get<IUnRedoService>()?.Register(new WPF.RootOperation,改名标题)。Name不同且字符检查通过时，在SDK赋名之前注册ReNameUnRedoOperation(SetNewName,SetOldName,new UnRedo_NameData(VMModule.FullName,VMModule.Name,value))；相同名只调用RemoveEmptyOperation。字符拒绝提前return与VmException catch均没有同名分支的RemoveEmptyOperation，不能说每种失败/取消自动删空root或回滚已注册part。",
