    {
      "id": "RH02",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: selected rename history and name-path resolution",
      "from": "UnRedo_NameData / ReNameUnRedoOperation",
      "to": "字符串快照与委托执行合同",
      "behavior": "UnRedo_NameData保存ModuleFullName/OldName/NewName三个string字段，不保存模块ID/GUID或模块对象。ReName操作构造保存RedoAction/UndoAction/Data，默认IsPart=true、IsDataComplete=true；Redo/Undo直接调用对应Action(Data,Params)，没有null门/catch/恢复逻辑，Update为空。Dispose清三个Action和Data，未清Params/ParentNode。",
