          "start": 3,
          "end": 27,
          "excerpt": "public class UnRedo_NameData\n{\n\t/// <summary>\n\t/// 模块对象名称\n\t/// </summary>\n\tpublic string ModuleFullName;\n\n\t/// <summary>\n\t/// 旧名称\n\t/// </summary>\n\tpublic string OldName;\n\n\t/// <summary>\n\t/// 新名称\n\t/// </summary>\n\tpublic string NewName;\n\n\tpublic UnRedo_NameData(string fullName, string oldName, string newName)\n\t{\n\t\tModuleFullName = fullName;\n\t\tOldName = oldName;\n\t\tNewName = newName;\n\t}\n}\n",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/ReNameUnRedoOperation.cs",
          "member": "Rename actions and lifecycle",
          "sha256": "0d1c4043b6339eda89464301d9f42b78acd2be53f67681b7546c8afd332aeda4",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 55,
          "excerpt": "public class ReNameUnRedoOperation : DisplayNotify, IUnRedoActionOperation, IUnRedoOperation, IDisposable, IUnRedoDataDone<UnRedo_NameData>\n{\n\tpublic bool IsPart { get; set; } = true;\n\n\tpublic UnRedo_NameData Data { get; set; }\n\n\tpublic IUnRedoParams Params { get; set; }\n\n\tpublic IBuilder ParentNode { get; set; }\n\n\tpublic Action<UnRedo_NameData, IUnRedoParams> RedoAction { get; set; }\n\n\tpublic Action<UnRedo_NameData, IUnRedoParams> UndoAction { get; set; }\n\n\tpublic Action<UnRedo_NameData> UpdateAction { get; set; }\n\n\tpublic bool IsDataComplete { get; set; } = true;\n\n\tpublic ExecutePriority ExecutePriority { get; set; }\n\n\tpublic ReNameUnRedoOperation(Action<UnRedo_NameData, IUnRedoParams> redoAction, Action<UnRedo_NameData, IUnRedoParams> undoAction, UnRedo_NameData data)\n\t{\n\t\tRedoAction = redoAction;\n\t\tUndoAction = undoAction;\n\t\tData = data;\n\t}\n\n\tpublic void Redo()\n\t{\n\t\tRedoAction(Data, Params);\n\t}\n\n\tpublic void Undo()\n\t{\n\t\tUndoAction(Data, Params);\n\t}\n\n\tpublic void Update()\n\t{\n\t}\n\n\tpublic void Dispose()\n\t{\n\t\tRedoAction = null;\n\t\tUndoAction = null;\n\t\tUpdateAction = null;\n\t\tData = null;\n\t}\n}\n",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "外部修改Data/委托/优先级、Dispose后重用及Params/ParentNode引用生命期未知；该对象不是事务或稳定实体句柄。"
      ],
      "operationComplete": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RH03",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: selected rename history and name-path resolution",
      "from": "SetOldName / SetNewName",
      "to": "原名称路径与改名后末段路径再解析",
      "behavior": "Undo目标SetOldName取ModuleFullName最后一个点之前的前缀，再拼点和NewName，用VmSolution.Instance[拼接路径]查找后as IVmModule写OldName。Redo目标SetNewName用最初ModuleFullName查找后写NewName；两者不使用unRedoParams、不验证对象ID/GUID、查找为空或类型不符都无保护。SetOldName也未检查LastIndexOf结果，单段路径会在Substring门失败；实际顶层/嵌套场景是否走到该输入仍单列。",
