        {
          "path": "analysis/decompiled/VMControls.WPF/VMControls.WPF.DataForUI/VmModuleBaseDecorator.cs",
          "member": "Undo and redo name-path identity",
          "sha256": "f124b9a5e3ce5b8e2e856d3e325b00a4b143f7074513ccc74d542ec35c2695dd",
          "start": 1176,
          "end": 1191,
          "excerpt": "\tprivate void SetOldName(UnRedo_NameData nameData, IUnRedoParams unRedoParams)\n\t{\n\t\tstring moduleFullName = nameData.ModuleFullName;\n\t\tstring text = moduleFullName.Substring(0, moduleFullName.LastIndexOf('.'));\n\t\tstring sub = text + \".\" + nameData.NewName;\n\t\tobject obj = VmSolution.Instance[sub];\n\t\t(obj as IVmModule).Name = nameData.OldName;\n\t}\n\n\tprivate void SetNewName(UnRedo_NameData nameData, IUnRedoParams unRedoParams)\n\t{\n\t\tobject obj = VmSolution.Instance[nameData.ModuleFullName];\n\t\t(obj as IVmModule).Name = nameData.NewName;\n\t}\n\n\tprivate void SkipToModuleCommandExecute()",
          "evidenceType": "local-decompiled-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
      ],
      "unknowns": [
        "父Group/流程随后改名、对象删除重建、同名遮蔽/冲突、无点路径与重复撤销的实际可达性未知；不能把重新按名字查找说成稳定身份恢复。"
      ],
      "operationComplete": false
    },
    {
      "id": "RH04",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: selected rename history and name-path resolution",
      "from": "VmFrameTreeBase.FullName / IVmFullPath",
      "to": "沿Parent或VmIO.Root组成名称路径",
      "behavior": "FullName从当前节点沿树上行到null或Name为空；普通节点拼UniqueName，ModuleType25换[UserVar]，VmIO按Parent存在与否加括号并转Root；最后去末尾点。VmModule.UniqueName返回Name，VmModule.FullName委托base，改名快照因此是当时名称树路径，不是GUID路径；父链后续变化不会自动重写UnRedo_NameData字符串。",
