    {
      "id": "RH05",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: selected rename history and name-path resolution",
      "from": "VmSolution[string] → VmFrameTreeBase[string]",
      "to": "流程首段及嵌套Group/模块逐段名字解析",
      "behavior": "方案indexer null返回null、空串返回自身，含[Params]直接返回字符串；首段在Modules按Name FirstOrDefault，另有VirtualPro/[UserVar]分支，有点递归vmModule剩余路径。基类空/NULL返回自身；方括号首段可交IVmExternPath，其余GetNode首段再试%包裹名；后续按VmFrameTreeBase、VmIOCollection或IList继续。VmModuleSet.GetNode非括号名优先GetModuleByProtocol按本层Modules.FirstOrDefault(Name)，再base；不是全方案按ID唯一搜索，嵌套Group只是同样逐层解析。",
