      "id": "RH07",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: selected rename history and name-path resolution",
      "from": "UnRedoSchedule.Register",
      "to": "录制条件、part与root构建",
      "behavior": "Register仅当_unRedoing<=0、_nLaziLoading<=0、可选CanRegister允许且必要栈非空、IsPart要求栈非空且top.ForbidBuild=false才构建；不满足时本体不加入/不Dispose传入对象。part经BuildPart，非part经BuildRoot，再通知。Root新建RootUnRedoOperation+SafeObservableCollection，复制IRootParam类型/ForbidBuild并TryPush；溢出时Dispose移出root。part先清redo栈，设ParentNode/top、显示名/IsUndoStack，再追加Actions。当前Register体没有按IsRunning/LockAreaStatus/IsOpenParam统一拒绝；外层入口权限不能由该体臆造。",
