          "start": 53,
          "end": 62,
          "excerpt": "\tpublic void Push(T item)\n\t{\n\t\tsl.Insert(0, item);\n\t\tif (Count > length)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tsl.RemoveAt(Count - 1);\n\t\t}\n\t\tOnPropertyChanged(\"EnumEntrysA\");\n\t}\n",
