    {
      "id": "RH09",
      "classification": "source-confirmed",
      "relation": "research: selected rename history and name-path resolution",
      "from": "RootUnRedoOperation / Rename part Params",
      "to": "优先级排序与RecoverStack是可用回调而非保证回滚",
      "behavior": "普通RootOperType分支Redo先Heigher再其它，Undo先Heigher逆序再其它逆序；另有CopyModule专用分支，本片不扩大其语义。BuildParams将dispatcher和recover表达式交每个part的新UnRedoParams。RecoverStack仅Pop来源并Push目标；改名part虽收到Params，SetOldName/SetNewName不读取、不调用recover，Rename Undo/Redo也无catch，因此不能说路径解析失败会自动把root搬回。Root执行循环一个Action抛错可跳过后续Action。",
