      "relation": "research: selected rename history and name-path resolution",
      "from": "RemoveEmptyOperation / RootOperation",
      "to": "仅top.Actions为空才弹栈，非通用失败清理",
      "behavior": "WPF.RootOperation是IsPart=false的标记，其Undo/Redo/Dispose均空；真实root由Schedule构建。RemoveEmptyOperation只在undo栈非空且(top as IBuilder).Actions.Count==0时Pop并通知，无Dispose、无_unRedoing/_nLaziLoading门，也不验证cast/Actions非空。对已注册改名part即使SDK写名失败，该root也不是空Actions；不能把RemoveEmptyOperation描述为撤销失败操作或完整取消。",
