      "behavior": "当前DocumentHistoryEngine.Replay先对尚未完成part调用CompleteNewValue，再将root从source移至destination，按Ordered执行；异常记录LastError并false返回，finally减replayDepth，无默认回滚。GraphEditorDocument.Undo/Redo在重放前调整快照视口合并。当前Parts恢复委托/文档值，不是原名称字符串再索引模块；不能用共同的栈次序证明身份解析或嵌套Group改名等价。",
      "refs": [
        {
          "path": "src/VisionEditor.Core/DocumentHistoryEngine.cs",
          "member": "Current independent replay",
          "sha256": "4f33d5d51a205be0c36e042cd8a25f024e93f0ffce1f81c9ebe29667216953aa",
          "start": 82,
          "end": 111,
          "excerpt": "    bool Replay(bool isUndo)\n    {\n        LastError = null;\n        replayDepth++;\n        try\n        {\n            var source = isUndo ? undo : redo;\n            var destination = isUndo ? redo : undo;\n            if (source.Count == 0) return false;\n            var root = source[^1];\n            if (isUndo)\n                foreach (var part in root.Parts.Where(part => !part.IsDataComplete).ToArray()) part.CompleteNewValue();\n            source.RemoveAt(source.Count - 1);\n            destination.Add(root);\n            Trim(destination);\n            foreach (var part in Ordered(root, isUndo))\n                if (isUndo) part.Undo(); else part.Redo();\n            return true;\n        }\n        catch (Exception error)\n        {\n            // Original service catches failures: no implicit rollback or safe retry is invented.\n            LastError = error;\n            return false;\n        }\n        finally { replayDepth--; }\n    }\n\n    static IEnumerable<DocumentHistoryPart<T>> Ordered(DocumentHistoryRoot<T> root, bool undo)\n    {",
          "evidenceType": "current-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        },
        {
          "path": "src/VisionEditor.Core/GraphEditorDocument.cs",
          "member": "Current document replay entry",
          "sha256": "4a44a59c96449a286eac7162e42a0b42dd012669f49e5aa810e1ce131799b558",
          "start": 282,
          "end": 291,
          "excerpt": "    public void Undo() {\n        if (history.CurrentRoot is { } root)\n            foreach (var part in root.Parts.Where(p=>p.IsDataComplete)) part.AdaptNewValue(MergeCurrentView);\n        history.Undo();\n    }\n    public void Redo() {\n        if (history.NextRedoRoot is { } root)\n            foreach (var part in root.Parts) part.AdaptOldValue(MergeCurrentView);\n        history.Redo();\n    }",
          "evidenceType": "current-source",
          "binaryIdentity": "not revalidated in this slice"
        }
